# rust
### The version: RUST_VER of the project overrides it
RUST_VER=${RUST_VER:-1.99.0}
PKG_VER=${RUST_VER}
### The standalone installers of the Rust project, installed by their install.sh (postbuild.sh), no
### rustup. This file is the Rust of the image: rustc, cargo, rustfmt and clippy for the machine of the
### platform, with its standard library. The Rust of the build machine and the standard library the
### cross builds link are the native targets (variants/target/native, native-std)
BUILD_PROCESS=none
RUST_TARGET=$( cargo_target )
PKG_URL="https://static.rust-lang.org/dist/rust-${PKG_VER}-${RUST_TARGET}.tar.xz"
PKG_SRCDIR=rust_${PKG_VER}-${RUST_TARGET}
RUST_COMPONENTS="rustc,cargo,rustfmt-preview,clippy-preview,rust-std-${RUST_TARGET}"
